-- title:
--   Caccetta–Häggkvist for $r = 4$
-- statement:
--   **The rung $r=4$ of the Caccetta–Häggkvist conjecture** (Hoàng and Reed, 1987). Every loopless digraph on $n\ge 1$ vertices in which every vertex has out-degree at least $4$ contains a directed cycle of length at most $\lceil n/4\rceil$:
--
--   $$\delta^+(D)\ge 4 \implies \text{girth}(D)\le\lceil n/4\rceil .$$
-- source:
--   C. T. Hoàng, B. Reed, A note on short cycles in digraphs, Discrete Math. 66 (1987), 103–107, https://doi.org/10.1016/0012-365X(87)90122-1

import Definitions.Def_TenChallenges_Challenge_03

